    "selection_rule": "Human-reviewed non-composite judgment. Stage A: codebook-invariant quality (DA, daily RankIC, MAPE) with per-window floors. Stage B: capacity-normalized behaviour alignment against the same-day target, not raw Collapse or raw Unique counts. Stage C: tokenizer reconstruction and per-layer codebook occupancy.",
